Package: vitaetypst
Type: Package
Title: Data-Driven CVs for Quarto
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Aaron",
           family = "Wenger",
           email = "aaron.wenger@protonmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = ""))
Description: Provides templates and functions to quickly create long CVs
    (curriculum vitae), short resumes', and accessory application documents
    in a clean and consistent style. Inspired by the `vitae` package for 
    `Rmarkdown` via LaTeX, but for Quarto via Typst.
